<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 5.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 5	Feb 4	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  259.310     259.600     247.020    4.98 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.000     305.850     306.830   -0.60 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.370     158.175     158.970   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.540	46.792	47.182   -1.36 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  420.700     421.200     419.180    0.36 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.110     140.835     141.685   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.951	16.033	16.185   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  210.120     212.590     212.430   -1.09 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.859	 1.865	 1.888   -1.54 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.574	 1.581   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.290     182.430     183.135   -1.01 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
